{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家，抱歉我迟到了～”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3440", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～♪”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 302, "voice": "_pn0652", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一天，美羽学姐突然召集了社员。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "下星期就是美羽学姐的毕业典礼了。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们大概猜得到她要说什么。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你们这么忙还来这一趟。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3441", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天啊，有很重要的事情要对大家说。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3442", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……是新社长的事吗？”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5200", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪问出了大家共同的疑问。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。虽然拖到这个时期，但是可以让我来选吗？”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3443", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那是当然了……大家也没问题吧？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5201", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，由天羽学姐来选是最好的。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "_ar6669", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，这样最好。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "_sk5394", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果本人安洁被选为社长的话，将会把这个喵喵社打造成世界知名的全球性动物王国──”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_ag3996", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，小菜夏有女仆的工作很忙的，所以我就不选你了。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3444", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么～～～！怎么这样美羽学姐，不需要那种体贴喔，安洁的动物王国……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_ag3997", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来安洁很想当社长啊。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过我已经知道下一任社长是谁了。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾也觉得交给美羽学姐选可以吧？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5202", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，当然了。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我回答，纱凪点点头重新转向美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3445", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐微笑着看着每一位社员。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后跨出一步走到我猜测的那位下任社长面前。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新任社长，可以拜托小纱凪吗？”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3446", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……我、我吗？但是……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5203", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想了很多喔。然后觉得果然还是小纱凪。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3447", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你愿意接受吗……？”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3448", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5204", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是全部的人都能认同的选择。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是纱凪不安地看着大家。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我这种人继承学姐的职位……负担太重了。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不可能变成像学姐这样！”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，副社长可以交给新吾君吗？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3449", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学、学姐！我的话还没有……”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我站到慌张的纱凪身旁，拍了拍她的头。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道了。为了守护这个社团和动物们，大家会齐心协力努力的。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，拜托你们了♪”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3450", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、等一下！我还没有接受社长这个……”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管是谁来选，都只有纱凪喔。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "_ar6670", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我也这么想。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "_sk5395", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天开始，这里就是小纱同学的动物王国了！”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_ag3998", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是──”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5209", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3451", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5210", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐握住纱凪的手，凝视着她的眼睛。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3452", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她们两人彼此传达了什么想法呢？", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只知道纱凪努力忍住不哭。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐的笑容依然没变。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3453", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的手动了。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正要像平常那样温柔地摸纱凪的头。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是美羽学姐的中途停止了，她的手缩回胸口。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……拜托你了，新吾君。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3454", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好的。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么学姐不摸纱凪的头呢？", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我思考了一下她的用意。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐推了推纱凪的背。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个没有自信的她。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在已经不需要别人摸摸头说乖孩子了。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算美羽学姐不在，纱凪也能一个人撑起社团了。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐……我……”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5211", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3455", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪握紧拳头，原本低垂的视线也抬起来看着美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“社长，我接下了。虽然我想我没办法成为像学姐这样优秀的社长……”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5212", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是我会尽我最大的努力。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5213", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3456", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到纱凪的话，学姐开心地笑了。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你，麻烦你了喔，小纱凪。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "_mu3457", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好的！”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_sn5214", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，所有人都面带笑容。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这里，从以前就是这样的场所。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
